WEBVTT

00:04.640 --> 00:06.640
This matter, listen to Xie Xuan.

00:07.400 --> 00:12.600
If Shilang's army really wants to retreat why go to such lengths to block information.

00:12.680 --> 00:18.520
Not even a carrier pigeon can enter now we're cornered and completely blind.

00:18.600 --> 00:23.400
At this time we're most likely to become gamblers the more so.

00:23.480 --> 00:25.147
The less we should move.

00:26.800 --> 00:28.467
Hurry to repair the walls.

00:28.800 --> 00:30.000
Yes.

00:30.080 --> 00:31.000
Xie Xuan.

00:31.080 --> 00:31.760
General Liu.

00:31.920 --> 00:33.360
Continue adding internal defenses.

00:33.920 --> 00:34.240
Yes.

00:34.320 --> 00:35.720
Yes.

01:02.480 --> 01:04.480
No movement in the city yet.

01:05.280 --> 01:10.440
Reporting, General not yet that coward Prince of Jin is as timid as a mouse scared by the general.

01:10.520 --> 01:11.920
Won't move a step.

01:12.920 --> 01:15.720
General chanyu Ayidai these past days.

01:15.800 --> 01:20.520
Has been sending messages asking if we don't take Yiyang soon hurry, hurry, hurry.

01:20.600 --> 01:21.960
Hurry your mother.

01:24.600 --> 01:26.267
Prince of Jin Sikong Yao.

01:27.040 --> 01:28.600
I'll remember this.

01:30.520 --> 01:34.560
Return to camp tell the other side to prepare for me.

01:37.600 --> 01:39.000
Report.

01:40.520 --> 01:42.520
No activity found in the south.

01:44.720 --> 01:45.880
Report.

01:45.960 --> 01:47.960
No activity found in the west.

01:51.400 --> 01:53.067
Could they really have withdrawn?

02:04.720 --> 02:05.280
What's going on?

02:05.360 --> 02:06.080
Report.

02:06.160 --> 02:11.720
Urgent report urgent report from the west the Wuzhao have broken in from the west into the city.

02:11.800 --> 02:13.200
How could they enter the city?

02:13.280 --> 02:15.560
Don't panic yet what's the situation in the west now?

02:15.640 --> 02:20.640
I've been hearing sounds these past days I've been resting poorly lately always hearing.

02:20.720 --> 02:24.960
Tapping sounds always dreaming of Wuzhao horses trampling me.

02:25.400 --> 02:31.400
I thought it was hallucinations now I know the Wuzhao dug tunnels undermining the wall foundations.

02:31.560 --> 02:34.720
The Wuzhao elite have already emerged from the tunnels taking the gates.

02:34.800 --> 02:37.133
General Liu is holding with his men.

02:39.600 --> 02:40.840
Report.

02:40.920 --> 02:46.520
The Wuzhao army from the north has turned back preparing to attack the city the north many volunteers at the west gate.

02:46.600 --> 02:52.080
If they defect I'm afraid we can't hold yes, we can't hold this is fighting on two fronts but we have so few men.

02:52.160 --> 02:53.760
Right how can we defend?

02:53.840 --> 02:55.240
We simply can't hold.

02:56.040 --> 02:57.440
Don't panic.

02:58.240 --> 03:03.080
Everyone reinforce the north the northern front will be commanded by General Zhu.

03:03.160 --> 03:08.680
Bring all available equipment must stop the Wuzhao main force I accept the order you all.

03:08.800 --> 03:09.400
Follow me.

03:09.480 --> 03:10.880
Yes.

03:15.720 --> 03:16.960
Xie Xuan.

03:17.040 --> 03:18.400
Your general is here.

